            "action_name": {
              "value": "Fatal Faker"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, conjuration, teleportation)\n\nTrigger: The carbuncle takes damage\n\nThe carbuncle feigns death by teleporting away and leaving a replica of its corpse behind, creating a colorful flash of light and a croaking sound. The real carbuncle transports to a clear space within 30 feet that it can see, and a hollow shell remains behind. The fake body appears solid until it is touched, at which point it crumbles to dust."
            },
